<title>BELGIUM: Belgo-Katanga H1 1996 profit up 58 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgo-Katanga H1 1996 profit up 58 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group net profit	    315.5  vs  200.1</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	     913.4  vs  845.4</p>
<p>    Dividend income	     495.4  vs  453.2</p>
<p>    Capital gains/losses	486.5  vs  253.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgo-Katanga is a Belgian holding company. In a statement, the company expected 1996 earnings to grow and to pay a higher 1996 dividend.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
